                        "sense_id": "dd67f626-eea8-32b1-9af1-dffa67137a58",
                        "entry_id": "6874c6ac-6e50-36eb-b4af-5d7e55aa3235",
                        "glosses": [
                            "dotyczący bratobójcy lub bratobójstwa"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16333f65-356e-495b-a68b-8851e6e09d3f",
                                "sense_id": "dd67f626-eea8-32b1-9af1-dffa67137a58",
                                "text": "Z tego samego archaicznego zasobu pojęciowego wywodzi się wciąż funkcjonujące w polszczyźnie określenie wojny domowej: \"walka bratobójcza\"."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0546ec24-1683-494d-9c4c-7ea4dfe4a7a2",
                        "source_entry_id": "6874c6ac-6e50-36eb-b4af-5d7e55aa3235",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd67f626-eea8-32b1-9af1-dffa67137a58",
                        "target_lang_word": "fratricidal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricidal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfdc52e6-407c-386c-b27a-68f1d9cdbe09",
                                        "entry_id": "512faa3a-8700-30e0-9f66-7f0f22745d8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to fratricide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af764115-4903-4100-8dd5-ea4a6c3e82fa",
                                                "sense_id": "bfdc52e6-407c-386c-b27a-68f1d9cdbe09",
                                                "text": "Taizong's failure fooled no one. Indeed, one of Taizong's own sons may well have been unhinged by his father's obvious fratricidal and nepoticidal actions. These personal considerations directly affected Taizong's policy decisions, and thus warrant some discussion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ed46c43-e633-40a6-9f04-e1c97a5b8c5f",
                                                "sense_id": "bfdc52e6-407c-386c-b27a-68f1d9cdbe09",
                                                "text": "At the Lincoln Memorial in Washington, which commemorates the president who urged a fratricidal nation to go forward “with malice toward none, with charity toward all,” the Olipa family debated what’s happened to leadership in America."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b9479075-124a-48ca-b8e3-a02390e62baf",
                        "source_entry_id": "6874c6ac-6e50-36eb-b4af-5d7e55aa3235",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd67f626-eea8-32b1-9af1-dffa67137a58",
                        "target_lang_word": "fratricide",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66221f1a-1800-3844-8976-c15823c71770",
                                        "entry_id": "dec667ff-3e7a-3c42-a499-a9db2566c800",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les guerres ou les luttes sanglantes entre frères ou concitoyens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95c2e2ff-22a1-4dbd-a109-d53a67813ea2",
                                                "sense_id": "66221f1a-1800-3844-8976-c15823c71770",
                                                "text": "Le Parti républicain se dirige vers des mois de luttes fratricides qui connaîtront leurs dénouements lors des élections de l’année prochaine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05496414-9e10-450d-8d03-af94d2b542cb",
                                                "sense_id": "66221f1a-1800-3844-8976-c15823c71770",
                                                "text": "Lutte fratricide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8fb9928-8dad-3e57-a464-36b6fe208684",
                                        "entry_id": "a13e0d31-09fe-3e4d-a522-c6c08e3c1add",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui tue son frère."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82f59a39-e3eb-4462-a417-eab27e02a83f",
                                                "sense_id": "a8fb9928-8dad-3e57-a464-36b6fe208684",
                                                "text": "Caïn fut le premier fratricide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24bf8c7c-5be3-41a3-9e2b-503f07aadc71",
                                                "sense_id": "a8fb9928-8dad-3e57-a464-36b6fe208684",
                                                "text": "[Rome fut] fondée et bâtie par un fratricide et formée par l'assemblage de femmes enlevées par force à leurs parents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdd972b0-3e13-3357-b19b-aeadea4fd505",
                                        "entry_id": "05ff90c0-13e9-3ed2-b2ae-1c26bc759d57",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Meurtre d’un frère."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1f0ea9f-db4a-4b94-8dda-374485d939f7",
                                                "sense_id": "cdd972b0-3e13-3357-b19b-aeadea4fd505",
                                                "text": "Tu t’es jeté sur mon épée, et voilà tout. Donc, aux yeux de Dieu et des hommes, je ne suis pas coupable du crime de fratricide ; donc tu n'as pas reçu une mission divine, mais infernale ; donc tu es sorti de la tombe, non comme une ombre sainte, mais comme un spectre maudit, et tu vas rentrer dans ta tombe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39650c73-19cc-425f-b39c-5dc84d6eaf14",
